VERSION_NAME=0.4.2-server-recent-hotfix
SHA256=5f32501c3292c528c35c32c4dc46bcb198d17cf60daa6d008ccb74a3c0cda542
NOTES=Hotfix: server connection test now reports correctly using stable server IDs and performs a real Xtream login or M3U playlist check instead of a simple HEAD request. Recent watching now keeps episode metadata so series episodes appear after restarting the app and can resume from the saved position. Recent and Favorites also load movie metadata automatically.
